[32m--INFO--Deepagent : tavily生成答案:{'query': '私募股权基金 信用债投资 S基金 不良资产处置 2024 2025', 'follow_up_questions': None, 'answer': None, 'images': [], 'results': [{'url': 'https://privatebank.jpmorgan.com/eur/en/insights/latest-and-featured/eotm/the-deep-end', 'title': 'The Deep End: 2025 Alternative Investments Review | J.P. Morgan Private Bank EMEA EN', 'content': 'And it’s that time of the year or two-year cycle again for us to do this. First, I apologize for the Tommy Bahama sweater, but I’m going fishing for Trini—for tarpon in Trinidad next week, and I need to wear the sweater with the fish on it to get me mentally ready and dialed in. And then just a couple of quick slides on another topic that we’ll be talking more about in the, in the, Outlook, which is the debt explosion in the fourth quarter related to all the hyperscalers and data centers. So here you can see this explosion at a $150 billion on top of what was really kind of $50 billion on a year-to-day basis. And the title of the alternatives piece this year is called “The Deep End.” And the, this is a guy that is up to his neck in and, in investments that he would otherwise like to already have sold.', 'score': 0.10339523, 'raw_content': None, 'id': '234abc-00'}, {'url': 'https://www.actionsxchangerepository.fidelity.com/ShowDocument/documentPDF.htm?_fax=-18%2342%23-61%23-110%23114%2378%23117%2320%23-1%2396%2339%23-62%23-21%2386%23-100%2337%2316%2335%23-68%2391%23-66%2354%23103%23-16%2369%23-30%2358%23-20%2376%23-84%23-11%23-87%230%23-50%23-20%23-92%23-98%23-116%23-28%2358%23-38%23-43%23-39%23-42%23-96%23-88%2388%23-45%23-101%23-41%2321%23-22%23110%23-57%23-128%2325%23-74%235%23-89%23-105%23-67%23126%2377%23-126%2350%23-18%23-110%23101%23112%2351%23122%2347%23117%23-103%23-97%2379%23116%23118%23-29%23-6%23121%2380%23-42%23-73%2329%23-33%23-57%2341%23-88%23118%2356%23120%23-59%23-86%2315%2390%23-2%2352%2392%23-30%23-50%23-108%2322%23124%2349%2335%23-91%2310%23-41%23105%2322%23-44%23-69%2352%2348%23102%2375%2344%23-78%2384%2354%2320%23-87%23-9%23-17%2319%23-70%23-102%23100%23-33%236%23-44%23-119%23-3%23-39%2385%23-5%23118%23-1%23-102%23127%23-89%23110%2317%2322%2328%2384%23-5%23110%23-4%238%2352%23126%2311%23-72%23-101%23-11%235%23-93%2325%2376%236%2342%2371%2325%2327%23-6%2368%23-34%23100%23102%231%2324%23-67%2388%23-110%23', 'title': '[PDF] Portfolio Holdings Listing Fidelity U.S. Bond Index Fund as of ...', 'content': 'The listing and top 10 holdings are not part of a fund’s annual/semiannual report or Form N-Q and have not been audited. The information provided in this listing and top 10 holdings may differ from a fund’s holdings disclosed in its annual/semiannual report and Form N-Q as follows, where applicable: With certain exceptions, the listing and top 10 holdings provide information on the direct holdings of a fund as well as a fund’s pro rata share of any securities and other investments held indirectly through investment in underlying non-money market Fidelity Central Funds. A fund’s pro rata share of the underlying holdings of any investment in high income and floating rate central funds is provided 60 days after month-end.', 'score': 0.06760222, 'raw_content': None, 'id': '34ca71-01'}, {'url': 'https://am.lombardodier.com/funds', 'title': 'Investment Funds', 'content': 'When you visit our website, information may be stored or recovered on your device, mainly in the form of cookies. We use essential cookies to ensure the website works as it should, and statistical and marketing cookies for audience measurement and content customisation purposes. We rely on Google to store your consent choices and manage the activation of cookies accordingly. From the Cookie Management Centre, you can set your preferences with respect to the use of cookies: accept or reject certain categories, accept all, or reject all. For detailed information on all cookies used across these three categories, please refer to our Cookie Policy. LO Funds (CH) - Short-Term Money Market (CHF) M D CurrencyCHFDate8/28/26NAV90.13Subscribe. LO Funds (CH) - Short-Term Money Market (EUR) M A CurrencyEURDate8/28/26NAV104.75. LO Funds (CH) - Short-Term Money Market (EUR) M D CurrencyEURDate8/28/26NAV96.38Subscribe. LO Funds (CH) - Short-Term Money Market (EUR) S A CurrencyEURDate8/28/26NAV104.97Subscribe. LO Funds (CH) - Short-Term Money Market (USD) I D CurrencyUSDDate8/28/26NAV101.8Subscribe.', 'score': 0.066794194, 'raw_content': None, 'id': '468f26-02'}, {'url': 'https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/private-credit-finds-exit-opportunities-111018038.html', 'title': 'Private credit finds exit opportunities among strategic buyers – DBRS', 'content': '2. Best 0% APR cards. 2. Best high-yield savings accounts. 3. Best money market accounts. With PE dealmaking and exit values dropping significantly in Q2, the private credit market is eager for exit opportunities. Data compiled by DBRS on discontinued private credit ratings show that an increasing number of borrower sales are related to strategic buyers, a separate category from sponsor-to-sponsor exits, according to a July 8 report. "While private equity exit activity remains generally suppressed across the middle market, we are encouraged to see growing involvement from non-private equity corporate buyers and the public markets in providing liquidity," said report author Michael Dimler, senior vice president of private corporate credit at DBRS. For the twelve months through July 3, 2026, more than half of ratings discontinuations related to sponsor exits were attributable to strategic buyers or IPOs, according to DBRS. See the full Morningstar DBRS report, "Sponsor Exits to Strategic Buyers a Growing Source of Private Rating Discontinuations," here.', 'score': 0.04282224, 'raw_content': None, 'id': '7ac688-03'}, {'url': 'https://www.morganstanley.com/im/en-us/institutional-investor/campaigns/liquidity.html', 'title': 'Liquidity | Morgan Stanley', 'content': 'For important information about the investment