[32m--INFO--Deepagent : tavily生成答案:{'query': 'private credit outlook 2025 2026 BlackRock贝莱德 投资建议', 'follow_up_questions': None, 'answer': None, 'images': [], 'results': [{'url': 'https://www.blackrock.com/us/financial-professionals/insights/private-markets-outlook-for-wealth-advisors', 'title': '2026 Private Markets Outlook for U.S. Wealth | BlackRock', 'content': 'Leave the BlackRock site for Advisors to explore other content. I consult or invest on behalf of a financial institution. ### Welcome to the BlackRock site for advisors. # 2026 Private Markets Outlook for U.S. wealth investors. BlackRock’s 2026 Private Markets Outlook builds on many of the themes explored last year, and one message for U.S. wealth investors is clear: private markets are moving from niche allocations to essential components of resilient portfolios. “*In 2026, private markets are set to transform how societies build infrastructure, how businesses finance growth, and how investors achieve diversification in their portfolios*.”. BlackRock, Private Markets Outlook 2026. Private credit has become a dominant channel for corporate financing, as banks remain selective. For investors, the combination of visibility, inflation linkage, and essential demand makes infrastructure a core allocation rather than an alternative. Vidy Vairavamurthy is the Chief Investment Officer for the Alternative Portfolio Solutions team within Multi-Alternatives at BlackRock. ## Private markets for advisors.', 'score': 0.8098936, 'raw_content': None, 'id': 'a8a080-00'}, {'url': 'https://www.blackrock.com/pt/profissionais/perspectivas/private-markets-outlook', 'title': '2026 Private Markets Outlook | BlackRock', 'content': 'Um\xa0**investidor privado**, também conhecido como cliente não profissional, é uma organização de clientes ou uma pessoa singular que não pode cumprir, ao mesmo tempo, com:. (1) um ou vários dos critérios de cliente profissional estabelecidos no Anexo II da Diretiva dos Mercados de Instrumentos Financeiros (Diretiva 2004/39/CE) e;. Um\xa0**investidor privado**, também conhecido como cliente não profissional, é uma organização de clientes ou uma pessoa singular que não pode cumprir, ao mesmo tempo, com (i) um ou vários dos critérios de cliente profissional estabelecidos no Anexo II da Diretiva dos Mercados de Instrumentos Financeiros (Diretiva 2004/39/CE) e (ii) um ou vários critérios de investidor qualificado estabelecidos no Artigo 2.º da Diretiva dos Prospetos (Diretiva 2003/71/CE).', 'score': 0.6396691, 'raw_content': None, 'id': '9098d4-01'}, {'url': 'https://www.blackrock.com/ch/professionals/en/insights/private-markets-outlook', 'title': '2026 Private Markets Outlook', 'content': '“By accessing this website you, as a client or potential client, accept to receive information on this website in more than one language.”. The following pages contain information on the foreign collective investment schemes managed by entities of the BlackRock Group, which have been approved by the Swiss Financial Market Supervisory Authority (FINMA) for offering to non-qualified investors in Switzerland in accordance with Article 119 CISA (“Approved Funds”), on collective investment schemes which have not been approved by FINMA (“Not Approved Funds”), Swiss domiciled iShares ETF Funds and BlackRock Investment Funds Switzerland as well as further financial instruments permitted for offering to retail and professional clients (such as iShares Exchange Traded Products). The prospectus including the integrated fund contract, the key information document or equivalent, and, if applicable, the annual as well as the semi-annual reports of the Swiss domiciled iShares Funds and BlackRock Investment Funds Switzerland are available free of charge from the Fund Management Company in Switzerland.', 'score': 0.6158511, 'raw_content': None, 'id': 'a80451-02'}, {'url': 'https://www.blackrock.com/us/financial-professionals/insights/navigating-a-maturing-private-credit-market', 'title': 'Navigating a maturing private credit market', 'content': 'Leave the BlackRock site for Advisors to explore other content. I consult or invest on behalf of a financial institution. I want to learn more about BlackRock. ### Welcome to the BlackRock site for advisors. # Navigating a maturing private credit market: Insight for advisors. * As the private credit market has matured, it has also grown more complex. * Recent stress in the market is not broad-based, in our assessment, but concentrated among specific borrowers, sectors and vintages. * While artificial intelligence (AI) is delivering disruption it is also surfacing an expanding set of opportunities over the next several years. That evolution has expanded the opportunity set, but it has also made the market more complex. For financial advisors, the story today is less about whether private credit remains attractive and more about where the most compelling opportunities may be emerging. That combination creates a favorable environment for income-oriented investments while reinforcing the need for careful credit selection.', 'score': 0.47358477, 'raw_content': None, 'id': '3b9bf3-03'}], 'response_time': 0.81, 'request_id': '043290f4-7047-4b14-a0ec-b0f162fc9ecd'}[0m
